@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Group member" as User
component "Swing desktop client\n(on each member's computer)" as Swing
component "Typed REST client" as HttpClient
component "Spring Boot REST service\nAuthentication + access checks" as Api
component "Application use cases" as App
component "Domain rules\nUSD splits / approvals / balances" as Domain
database "PostgreSQL\nShared system of record" as Db
component "Email sender adapter\nverification / reset" as Mail
component "Future web and\nmobile clients" as FutureClients

User --> Swing
Swing --> HttpClient
HttpClient --> Api : HTTPS / JSON
FutureClients --> Api : HTTPS / JSON
Api --> App
App --> Domain
App --> Db : transactional repositories
App --> Mail : one-time email flows

note right of Db
All desktop clients use this
shared database through the
service. Balances are derived
from approved expense shares
and recorded payments.
end note
@enduml
